      "title": "Situation overview",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "1a",
          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "A structural collapse at Aldan House on Cobbett Row in Nerridge resulted in the destruction of the building and its east wing, leaving the west wing intact.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "The incident caused multiple casualties, including confirmed injuries and fatalities, while prompt emergency responses by Nerridge Fire Service and Provincial Urban Search and Rescue successfully rescued multiple individuals.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Authorities deployed emergency management teams and police to manage hazardous conditions, assist displaced residents, coordinate relief, and prevent civil disruption.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.3"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
